{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30015_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:67d2f4fd9c2279aa162f45079c8bfd8d86b106ea25ded1d18b1759c6e0750976",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fba3ffbb76bd0c2cdf51e78042e9191b571fd0d0d99d173c4bf24c504215e0c",
      "text": "对台本当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5203601cb4f11e167e1c1dc7a057a44dcebe3d08aa706d7e8d34aab116124e53",
      "text": "这位就是这次向我们发出邀约的剧作家先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fafdf89c8be07eaf00a8a66f33eabefd0900271df90d2ec105fd47397ac6c9",
      "text": "初次见面，我是Altessimo的神乐丽。\n请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b03764919bb35937eb1b018823ba917b7387feb8645f3ae5a670083e50ba185",
      "text": "我也是Altessimo的都筑圭。请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc9947690883b508fee7d01d43757a62100f589368929191ff295cad34f43022",
      "text": "我才是。今天能见到二位很高兴。你们\n录制音乐节目的录影棚，我也在场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2006e9fa75b16c5f44fff37ea448293eb6e541f24a737fa82f1c7e10f54b34e3",
      "text": "在那里听到了《Tone's Destiny》。\n让我得到了新舞台剧的灵感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ed58bb81f44f299c0bec840baddea7602cbb48504d1c2ef1c4d3fcc67e9e20e",
      "text": "听了我们的歌……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b13be0a0637230ee546710982820eafec7ada0466bffaa0e73f8b23cf7ffb32e",
      "text": "哎～居然还有这样的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a649eb99db900d9255f29d4300b0df42cea587a72cccb9bcfd9b0f1ab39adc2",
      "text": "我希望能接下这份工作。Altessimo的\n两位有什么疑问吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c586c07fc5d00fae62f3018827f8c93f81ef4157aec438493df4c3c411b89f47",
      "text": "怎么说呢……坦白讲，虽说感到惊讶，\n但能以我们的歌为契机，真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0782b7830f7fcb78e28a94b53b6b34c71fd8456b411da599eab57efd5e85227",
      "text": "我非常想接受这份邀约。\n您觉得可以吗，都筑先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad408dbc676653b176323cbdf01c6ef095f080a2224ebf07ae1edebb2801256",
      "text": "嗯。\n虽然不知道我能不能做好，但我想试一试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4154751298a0f7d6c903c5cfe930cf647c9dd3af2c9cc6df3db154e5e6f2e78a",
      "text": "而且我也很想知道，从我们的歌声中，\n究竟诞生出了什么样的故事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000078:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000088:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:757a88dde6b4fb1fc0d368648ed1a702097bb8c2782d8a244291042cb7e65aa3",
      "text": "……辛苦了，是我。\n突然打电话给你，非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000090:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4dd7396808a7ff09295122732b6085f4274bfb167eb2d230ad61927660d376b",
      "text": "虽然听说你还在外头，\n但我想就这次的工作和你稍微谈一谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000092:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff7a151bc3246c0d6356d6bbbf48eabeef8d6a309948b43370aa2e1d7fde8ad9",
      "text": "要谈的事，就是关于今天那部舞台剧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000094:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcdccc7a5adf2305c3ad113f41a4bb533dfd4712210dd546b475cd92953095a2",
      "text": "就在你说要努力之后，马上就为我们带来了\n新工作的话题呢。我很感谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000096:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd99ebbe11b562eb0ddd122d9c2c25f0a88a4beb342efe4c1f9d44a7aad8e54",
      "text": "接着，接下来才是正题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000098:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3571b8b6906398254f2cd5f7c1f69a83356a130ebadd6be4b25c3646e8bbe2ba",
      "text": "之后正式的舞台排练一旦开始，\n也许会因为我不习惯而给你添麻烦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000100:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d9a31099c31ee2ff5e9576cc576a0eced9c318ce28f277c6e60c8f79c28bf63",
      "text": "虽然我会努力避免那样，\n但这次也能拜托你协助我们吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000102:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f26293ae977aad99865db832d30e7fb70de6f96d42cae73db8a1df03c28b6c0",
      "text": "当然了，这次我也\n会全力支持的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000105:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94330b0a76c1ba8d30b80e2e0b563f27328b6329b6f6e227999d79eebc514940",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n听到你这么说，我就安心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30015_01:1_3_30015_01_c:cmd-000107:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e02eaeef352a99268e95c8e4a1616018f535bcdc3bb03e0f2506de8e3e85cb6",
      "text": "为了不辜负你的期待，我会努力的。\n那么明天起，就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
